PBS Frontline's reporting.

4
00:00:07,461 --> 00:00:09,648
And every one of those accounts starts in

5
00:00:09,661 --> 00:00:10,612
the same place.

6
00:00:11,842 --> 00:00:14,420
A military prep school in Punjab called

7
00:00:14,433 --> 00:00:16,360
Cadet College Hasan Abdal.

8
00:00:17,538 --> 00:00:19,921
Tahawwur Rana was the son of a school

9
00:00:19,934 --> 00:00:20,585
principal.

10
00:00:20,961 --> 00:00:23,578
The other boy was born Daood Gilani.

11
00:00:23,983 --> 00:00:26,301
The world would later know him as David

12
00:00:26,314 --> 00:00:27,187
Coleman Headley.

13
00:00:27,642 --> 00:00:30,260
He had an American mother and a Pakistani

14
00:00:30,272 --> 00:00:30,832
father.

15
00:00:31,236 --> 00:00:33,944
Classmates never forgot his eyes — two

16
00:00:33,957 --> 00:00:34,856
different colours.

17
00:00:36,022 --> 00:00:37,702
The two boys became close.

18
00:00:38,092 --> 00:00:39,876
Then their lives split apart.

19
00:00:40,252 --> 00:00:42,179
Rana went into medicine.

20
00:00:42,611 --> 00:00:44,694
Headley drifted into drug trafficking,

21
00:00:45,006 --> 00:00:47,285
then a stint as an informant for the US

22
00:00:47,298 --> 00:00:49,499
Drug Enforcement Administration, and

23
00:00:49,512 --> 00:00:51,348
