24
00:00:52,614 --> 00:00:54,619
The friendship survived all of it.

25
00:00:55,036 --> 00:00:56,807
Rana's wife, Samraz,

26
00:00:57,419 --> 00:00:59,450
later told Frontline that the family

27
00:00:59,463 --> 00:01:01,312
considered Headley one of their own.

28
00:01:01,833 --> 00:01:03,252
He called her "sister."

29
00:01:03,721 --> 00:01:06,351
Her children called him "special uncle."

30
00:01:07,609 --> 00:01:09,445
That trust is the whole story.

31
00:01:09,862 --> 00:01:11,984
Everything that follows runs through it.

